    "title": "Image dataset of healthy and pathogen-affected maize leaves with suggested control measures",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.17085836",
    "publication_date": "2025-09-09",
    "description": "<p>This dataset contains images of maize (<em>Zea mays</em>, EPPO code: ZEAMX) crop, including both healthy plants and plants affected by major pathogens, collected during the experimentation of the PLANTHEAD Diagnostic Platform in Tanzania, within the framework of the EU Horizon2020 EWA-BELT Project (GA#862848).</p>\n<p>Within the dataset, the following diseases and their corresponding EPPO codes are represented:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Maize Lethal Necrosis (EPPO Code: n/a)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><em>Exserohilum turcicum</em> (EPPO Code: SETOTU)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Maize streak virus (EPPO Code: MSV000)*</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Each folder is organized by pathogen to facilitate data exploration and analysis. In addition, the dataset includes a PDF file providing recommended management solutions for each disease, including agronomic, biological, and chemical measures.</p>\n<p><em>*suggested control measures not available</em></p>",
